  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">R&#xE9;ponse Rapide aux besoins de protection, Abris/AME des populations d&#xE9;plac&#xE9;es au Nord-Kivu et Ituri</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of this project is to provide shelter, non-food items as well as protection assistance to vulnerable people in the Democratic Republic of the Congo. This UNHCR project provides emergency shelter, NFI and dignity kits, strengthens community-based protection, monitors protection incidents, and distributes cash for protection, among other activities. The project provides humanitarian assistance to 45,000 people in the Shelter/NFI sector and  5,750 people in the Protection sector.</narrative>
  </description>
